%% Context: E-commerce order fulfilment, including payment, inventory, and carrier exceptions.
flowchart TD
  A([Order received]) --> B[Validate order]
  B --> C{Payment authorised?}
  C -->|No| D[Notify payment failure]
  D --> E([Order cancelled])
  C -->|Yes| F[(Reserve inventory)]
  F --> G{All items available?}
  G -->|No| H[Offer backorder or refund]
  H --> I{Customer accepts backorder?}
  I -->|No| E
  I -->|Yes| J[Create replenishment order]
  J -.-> F
  G -->|Yes| K[[Release pick list]]
  K ==> L[Pick items]
  L --> M[Pack and label]
  M --> N{Carrier collection confirmed?}
  N -->|No| O[Hold for next collection]
  O -.-> N
  N -->|Yes| P>Dispatch shipment]
  P --> Q([Confirmation sent])
